| Proposed type      | Reuses                           | New?  |
|--------------------|----------------------------------|-------|
| Edge (in snapshot) | core/ir Edge directly            | No    |
| BoundaryInfo       | detect_boundaries() result       | No    |
| OutputSummary      | Extracts print_log_entry() logic | Partial |
| ProgressObserver   | Formalizes CiContext pattern      | Yes   |
| Symbol system      | Parallels language SubDag module | Yes   |
| DagProgress        | New state machine (different from ExecutionLog) | Yes |
| FrameLoop          | New (no existing frame concept)  | Yes   |

Key principle: no new types where existing ones suffice. DagSnapshot uses
Edge directly. Observer formalizes what CiContext already does ad-hoc.
Symbol system follows exact same patterns as language module.

