## Implementation phases

1. **Symbol system** — core/ir/src/symbols.rs: types, STANDARD set, tests
2. **Observer + snapshot** — core/exec/src/progress.rs: trait, DagSnapshot,
   OutputSummary; wire into execute_flat()
3. **Frame loop** — FrameLoop trait, FramePolicy enum, synchronous driver
4. **Terminal renderer** — standard mode: layout, carriage-return, emoji default
5. **Dynamic mode** — wavefront, morph, cellular automaton, adaptive timing
6. **CI integration** — CiProgressObserver wrapping CiContext
7. **Polish** — spinner animation, compact mode, TTY detection
8. **Web** (future) — JSON serialization, SSE endpoint, browser renderer

