## Appendix C: Dynamic mode animation frames

### Edge wavefront propagation

```
  Frame 0:  ● A ──────── ○ B       (A completed)
  Frame 1:  ● A ═─────── ○ B       (wavefront starts)
  Frame 2:  ● A ═══───── ○ B       (propagating)
  Frame 4:  ● A ════════ ○ B       (fully energized)
  Frame 6:  ● A ────════ ● B       (B started, settling)
  Frame 7:  ● A ──────── ● B       (edge done)
```

### Node state morph (unicode tier)

```
  Pending→Running:   ○  →  ◔  →  ◑  →  ◐
  Running→Completed: ◐  →  ◕  →  ⬤  →  ●
  Running→Failed:    ◐  →  ◉  →  ✗
```

### Cellular automaton idle animation (Rule 110)

```
  Frame 0:  ● A ─·──·─── ○ B
  Frame 1:  ● A ──·──·── ○ B
  Frame 2:  ● A ───·──·─ ○ B       (dots shift along edge)
```
